[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4622.98, "timestamp": "01:17:02", "text": "星期五晚上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4648.63, "timestamp": "01:17:28", "text": "我发出高音。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4650.95, "timestamp": "01:17:30", "text": "，我想这就是为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4655.59, "timestamp": "01:17:35", "text": "你唱歌的时候有时会出现破音的原因。 你的嗓子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4657.59, "timestamp": "01:17:37", "text": "在某个时候会变得非常吃力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4661.189, "timestamp": "01:17:41", "text": "。 顺便说一句，我已经听起来很厉害了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4663.03, "timestamp": "01:17:43", "text": "。"}]